yle=\"padding:0em 0.25em\"><a href=\"/wiki/Svenska_cupen_i_fotboll_2000/2001\" title=\"Svenska cupen i fotboll 2000/2001\">Svenska cupen 2000/2001</a> (<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Finalen_av_Svenska_cupen_i_fotboll_2000/2001&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Finalen av Svenska cupen i fotboll 2000/2001 [inte skriven än]\">final</a>)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height:2px\"><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\"navbox-group\" style=\";;\">Lag</td><td style=\"text-align:left;border-left:2px solid #fdfdfd;width:100%;padding:0px;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotbolls_s%C3%A4song_2001\" title=\"AIK Fotbolls säsong 2001\">AIK</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_herrfotboll_2001\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF herrfotboll 2001\">Djurgårdens IF</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gais_2001\" title=\"Gais 2001\">Gais</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping_2001\" title=\"IFK Norrköping 2001\">IFK Norrköping</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_FF_2001\" title=\"Malmö FF 2001\">Malmö FF</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r59246309\" /><table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0; ;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table class=\"navbox-inner collapsible autocollapse\" style=\"width:100%;border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div style=\"float:left; width:3em;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"background-color:transparent; padding:0; white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; border:none;; color: inherit;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Superettan_genom_tiderna\" title=\"Mall:Superettan genom tiderna\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\"border:none;;\">v</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Superettan_genom_tiderna&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Superettan_genom_tiderna&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\"border:none;;\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">r</span></a></div></div><span style=\"font-size:110%;\">Säsonger av näst högsta divisionen i fotboll i <a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\">Sverige</a> för herrar</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><td class=\"navbox-group\" style=\";;\">Inofficiell</td><td style=\"text-align:left;border-left:2px solid #fdfdfd;width:100%;padding:0px;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Division_II_i_fotboll_1920/1921&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Division II i fotboll 1920/1921 [inte skriven än]\">1920/1921</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span><span style=\"color:#AAA;\">1921/1922</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Division_II_i_fotboll_1922/1923&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Division II i fotboll 1922/1923 [inte skriven än]\">1922/1923</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Division_II_i_fotboll_1923/1924&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Division II i fotboll 1923/1924 [inte skriven än]\">1923/1924</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span><a href=\"/wiki/Division_II_i_fotboll_1924/1925\" title=\"Division II i fotboll 1924/1925\">1924/1925</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/Division_II_i_fotboll_1925/1926\" title=\"Division II i fotboll 1925/1926\">1925/1926</a><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">&#160;· </span> <a href=\"/wiki/Division_II_i_fotbol